    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bashing Brutal is a fully Physics-Based combat game, focusing on melee fighting. Experience the Brutal life of a Gladiator, Bash your opponent's heads in with Maces, Boxing Gloves, Baseball Bats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are fighting in a Gladiator Arena, Boxing Ring, MMA Octagon, or on The Streets, your impacts will be Felt!<br>Satisfying physics-based hit reactions and Gore. Blood, Blood everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters and Combat aren't the only things that use physics. Everything in the Environment uses cutting edge physics simulation.</p>",
